  "data": {
    "summary": "Whenever a **[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)** weapon is used for an attack, you may disregard whichever modifiers you choose (up to all of them) to the BS or WS of that attack and to its hit roll. Such attacks count as psychic attacks, which matters for rules that trigger on them.",
